{
  "id": 8834723807431,
  "title": "Custom Cardinals on Flowering Branches Quilt with Name",
  "handle": "custom-cardinals-on-flowering-branches-quilt-47d5316f3d-47d5316f3d",
  "body_html": "<p>Bring the beauty of winter nature into your home with this beautiful quilt from Jeminise. Featuring a realistic patchwork design of Christmas couple red birds on flowering branches, this cozy bedding layer is perfect for adding a touch of holiday warmth or weekday comfort to your bedroom or guest room.</p>\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Easily personalize your quilt by adding your custom name or text and choosing your preferred size or optional matching pillowcases.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Feel:</strong> The outer layer is made of breathable, soft polyester fabric filled with high-quality silk floss for lightweight, all-season warmth.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor and outdoor activities, including bed bedding, sofa lounging, backyard relaxation, picnics, or camping.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Choose from 5 versatile sizes to fit your needs: Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), and King (102x91 inches).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Comes as a single quilt with the option to add matching pillowcases (20x30 inches) to complete your custom bedding set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; dries quickly on a low-heat or air-dry cycle to stay soft and fluffy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Xmas Couple Red Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Patchwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw/Twin/Full/Queen/King</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
